# Cloudflare Static Assets 只认资源根目录下的 _headers。
# 插件市场索引（D104 P1-1，infra/cloudflare/plugins/README.md）：与连接器目录同款短缓存。
/plugins/v1/index.json
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/plugins/v1/index.json.sig
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
